no&quot;">html2pdf().from(element).set({ margin: 0, filename: 'resume.pdf', html2canvas: { scale: 2 }, jsPDF: { format: 'letter', unit: 'in' } }).save()</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">.</span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700">Critical</span><span>: text must be selectable in the resulting PDF (real text layer, not a rasterized image). If </span><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Roboto Mono&quot;">html2canvas</span><span>&nbsp;produces an image-only PDF, switch to </span><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Roboto Mono&quot;">jsPDF.html()</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;or generate text directly via jsPDF for ATS compatibility.</span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Embed fonts using web-safe fallbacks (Garamond ‚Üí "EB Garamond" / Georgia, Calibri ‚Üí Helvetica, etc.).</span></li></ul><h2 id="h.72nti0xhdxis" style="padding-top:18pt;margin:0;color:#000000;padding-left:0;font-size:16pt;padding-bottom:4pt;line-height:1.15;page-break-after:avoid;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;orphans:2;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:17pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Export: Word (.docx)</span></h2><ul class="lst-kix_j0khzu16m13t-0 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span>Use the </span><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Roboto Mono&quot;">docx</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;npm library (works in browser).</span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">Translate the template's structure into Word equivalents:</span></li></ul><ul class="lst-kix_j0khzu16m13t-1 start" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:72pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700">Banner section headers</span><span>&nbsp;‚Üí </span><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Roboto Mono&quot;">Heading1</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;style with shaded paragraph background</span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:72pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700">Bold title left + date right</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;‚Üí paragraph with right-aligned tab stop, not a table</span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:72pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700">Italic honors / tagline</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;‚Üí italic run within paragraph</span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:72pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700">Bullets</span><span>&nbsp;‚Üí </span><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Roboto Mono&quot;">bullet</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;numbering style</span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:72pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span style="font-weight:700">Decorative corner mark</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;‚Üí omit in DOCX (or replace with a subtle horizontal rule); ATS doesn't care about decorations and Word's rendering of shapes is fragile</span></li></ul><ul class="lst-kix_j0khzu16m13t-0" style="padding:0;margin:0"><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span>Use </span><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Roboto Mono&quot;">Document</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">&nbsp;styles, not direct formatting, so the user can re-style in Word easily.</span></li><li style="padding-top:12pt;color:#000000;padding-left:0pt;font-size:11pt;padding-bottom:12pt;line-height:1.15;margin-right:0;margin-left:36pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;margin-top:0;orphans:2;margin-bottom:0;widows:2;text-align:left;padding-right:0"><span>Trigger download via </span><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Roboto Mono&quot;">Packer.toBlob()</span><span>&nbsp;+ </span><span style="color:#188038;font-weight:400;font-family:&quot;Roboto Mono&quot;">URL.createObjectURL()</span><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal">.</span></li></ul><hr><p style="padding:0;margin:0;color:#000000;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;line-height:1.15;orphans:2;widows:2;height:11pt;text-align:left"><span style="color:#000000;font-weight:400;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;;font-style:normal"></span></p><h2 id="h.rfrhj8bg0ra4" style="padding-top:18pt;margi